        &lt;span&gt;TL;DR&lt;/span&gt;
      &lt;/div&gt;
      &lt;div class=&#34;admonition-content&#34;&gt;
        &lt;p&gt;For the A1106 specifically - using the right USB port, use the command &lt;code&gt;probe-usb boot usb0/disk@1:,\\:tbxi&lt;/code&gt; in OpenFirmware to boot. Read further if you want to see me slowly lose my sanity trying to work this out.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
